{"seq":5,"slug":"text-formatting","title":"文本与消息格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/accessibility-i18n/i18n-fundamentals/text-formatting","wordCount":663,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"文本与消息格式化\">文本与消息格式化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>文本格式化是 i18n 中最复杂的领域之一。不同语言的语法规则差异巨大——复数形式（英语 2 种，阿拉伯语 6 种）、性别一致性、词序变化、数字嵌入方式等都需要格式化系统处理。ICU MessageFormat 是业界标准的消息格式化语法，被 react-intl 和 i18next 等主流库采用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[消息格式化] --&gt; B[简单插值]&#10;    A --&gt; C[复数处理]&#10;    A --&gt; D[选择分支]&#10;    A --&gt; E[嵌套格式化]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;你好,{name}&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;{count, plural, one {1 项} other {# 项}}&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;{gender, select, male {他} female {她} other {TA}}&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[日期 + 数字 + 复数嵌套]\">graph TD\n    A[消息格式化] --&gt; B[简单插值]\n    A --&gt; C[复数处理]\n    A --&gt; D[选择分支]\n    A --&gt; E[嵌套格式化]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[\"你好,{name}\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"{count, plural, one {1 项} other {# 项}}\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"{gender, select, male {他} female {她} other {TA}}\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[日期 + 数字 + 复数嵌套]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式化类型</th>\n<th>ICU 语法</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>适用语言</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单插值</td>\n<td><code>{name}</code></td>\n<td>你好，{name}</td>\n<td>所有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字格式化</td>\n<td><code>{count, number}</code></td>\n<td>{count, number} 条</td>\n<td>所有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期格式化</td>\n<td><code>{date, date, medium}</code></td>\n<td>{date, date, medium}</td>\n<td>所有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复数</td>\n<td><code>{count, plural, ...}</code></td>\n<td>6 种复数形式</td>\n<td>阿拉伯语等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择</td>\n<td><code>{type, select, ...}</code></td>\n<td>性别、类型分支</td>\n<td>所有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序数</td>\n<td><code>{pos, selectordinal, ...}</code></td>\n<td>1st, 2nd, 3rd</td>\n<td>英语等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"复数处理\">复数处理</h2><p>复数是 i18n 中最容易出错的领域。不同语言的复数规则差异极大，Unicode CLDR 定义了六种复数类别：zero、one、two、few、many、other。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ICU MessageFormat 复数语法&#10;const messages = {&#10;  &#39;zh-CN&#39;: {&#10;    items: &#39;{count, plural, =0 {没有项目} other {共 {count} 个项目}}&#39;,&#10;    unread: &#39;{count, plural, =0 {没有未读消息} other {{count} 条未读消息}}&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  &#39;en-US&#39;: {&#10;    items: &#39;{count, plural, =0 {No items} one {1 item} other {{count} items}}&#39;,&#10;    unread: &#39;{count, plural, =0 {No unread messages} one {1 unread message} other {{count} unread messages}}&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  &#39;ar-SA&#39;: {&#10;    items: &#39;{count, plural, =0 {لا عناصر} one {عنصر واحد} two {عنصران} few {{count} عناصر} many {{count} عنصرًا} other {{count} عنصر}}&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;}&#10;&#10;// react-intl 使用复数&#10;import { FormattedMessage } from &#39;react-intl&#39;&#10;&#10;const ItemCount: FC&lt;{ count: number }&gt; = ({ count }) =&gt; (&#10;  &lt;FormattedMessage&#10;    id=&quot;items&quot;&#10;    defaultMessage=&quot;{count, plural, =0 {No items} one {1 item} other {{count} items}}&quot;&#10;    values={{ count }}&#10;  /&gt;&#10;)&#10;&#10;// i18next 复数处理&#10;// en-US.json&#10;// &quot;item&quot;: &quot;{{count}} item&quot;&#10;// &quot;item_plural&quot;: &quot;{{count}} items&quot;&#10;// &quot;item_zero&quot;: &quot;No items&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ICU MessageFormat 复数语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> messages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'zh-CN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    items: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{count, plural, =0 {没有项目} other {共 {count} 个项目}}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    unread: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{count, plural, =0 {没有未读消息} other {{count} 条未读消息}}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'en-US'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    items: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{count, plural, =0 {No items} one {1 item} other {{count} items}}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    unread: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{count, plural, =0 {No unread messages} one {1 unread message} other {{count} unread messages}}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'ar-SA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    items: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{count, plural, =0 {لا عناصر} one {عنصر واحد} two {عنصران} few {{count} عناصر} many {{count} عنصرًا} other {{count} عنصر}}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// react-intl 使用复数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { FormattedMessage } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-intl'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ItemCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">FormattedMessage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"items\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    defaultMessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{count, plural, =0 {No items} one {1 item} other {{count} items}}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    values</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ count }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// i18next 复数处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// en-US.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"item\": \"{{count}} item\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"item_plural\": \"{{count}} items\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"item_zero\": \"No items\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>复数类别数</th>\n<th>规则描述</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>中文</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>只有 other</td>\n<td>3 个项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英语</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>one + other</td>\n<td>1 item / 3 items</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>俄语</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>one + few + other</td>\n<td>1/2-4/5+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阿拉伯语</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>全部六种</td>\n<td>0/1/2/3-10/11-99/100+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日语</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>只有 other</td>\n<td>3つの項目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数字与货币格式化\">数字与货币格式化</h2><p>数字和货币的格式在不同地区差异显著——千分位分隔符、小数点符号、货币符号位置等都需要本地化。浏览器内置的 Intl API 是处理这些格式化的标准方案。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Intl.NumberFormat — 数字格式化&#10;const formatNumber = (value: number, locale: string) =&gt; {&#10;  return new Intl.NumberFormat(locale).format(value);&#10;};&#10;&#10;formatNumber(1234567.89, &#39;en-US&#39;); // &quot;1,234,567.89&quot;&#10;formatNumber(1234567.89, &#39;de-DE&#39;); // &quot;1.234.567,89&quot;&#10;formatNumber(1234567.89, &#39;zh-CN&#39;); // &quot;1,234,567.89&quot;&#10;formatNumber(1234567.89, &#39;ar-SA&#39;); // &quot;١٬٢٣٤٬٥٦٧٫٨٩&quot;&#10;&#10;// 货币格式化&#10;const formatCurrency = (amount: number, currency: string, locale: string) =&gt; {&#10;  return new Intl.NumberFormat(locale, {&#10;    style: &#39;currency&#39;,&#10;    currency,&#10;    minimumFractionDigits: 2,&#10;    maximumFractionDigits: 2,&#10;  }).format(amount);&#10;};&#10;&#10;formatCurrency(1299.5, &#39;USD&#39;, &#39;en-US&#39;); // &quot;$1,299.50&quot;&#10;formatCurrency(1299.5, &#39;EUR&#39;, &#39;de-DE&#39;); // &quot;1.299,50 €&quot;&#10;formatCurrency(1299.5, &#39;CNY&#39;, &#39;zh-CN&#39;); // &quot;¥1,299.50&quot;&#10;formatCurrency(1299.5, &#39;JPY&#39;, &#39;ja-JP&#39;); // &quot;￥1,300&quot;&#10;&#10;// 紧凑格式（大数字简写）&#10;const formatCompact = (value: number, locale: string) =&gt; {&#10;  return new Intl.NumberFormat(locale, {&#10;    notation: &#39;compact&#39;,&#10;    compactDisplay: &#39;short&#39;,&#10;  }).format(value);&#10;};&#10;&#10;formatCompact(1500000, &#39;en-US&#39;); // &quot;1.5M&quot;&#10;formatCompact(1500000, &#39;zh-CN&#39;); // &quot;150万&quot;&#10;formatCompact(1500000, &#39;ja-JP&#39;); // &quot;150万&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Intl.NumberFormat — 数字格式化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> formatNumber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">locale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Intl.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NumberFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(locale).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1234567.89</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'en-US'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"1,234,567.89\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatNumber</span><span style=\"co